{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19611","headline":"三月五日陪裴大夫泛长沙东湖 · 崔护","name":"三月五日陪裴大夫泛长沙东湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上巳余风景，芳辰集远垧。\n彩舟浮泛荡，绣毂下娉婷。\n林树回葱蒨，笙歌入杳冥。\n湖光迷翡翠，草色醉蜻蜓。\n鸟弄桐花日，鱼翻谷雨萍。\n从今留胜会，谁看画兰亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔护","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}